    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is a cute little precision platformer with puzzle elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift and toss crates to traverse over spikes and reach higher ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh down buttons to create platforms and solve the puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself and make tight jumps! You got this! &lt;3 (:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is Open Source - View on GitHub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development started in PICO-8, now made with Godot Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: Mac build is untested</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is a cute little precision platformer with puzzle elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift and toss crates to traverse over spikes and reach higher ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh down buttons to create platforms and solve the puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself and make tight jumps! You got this! &lt;3 (:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Crate is Open Source - View on GitHub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development started in PICO-8, now made with Godot Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: Mac build is untested</p>",
